  "reference": "Unit-area homogeneous slab with independent wall temperatures. DG takes the union of ramp knots and reporting times and integrates the linear wall load on each interval with the semidiscrete matrix exponential. Compare constant Legendre modes to exact Fourier cell averages and signed numerical face heat to differences in cumulative analytical heat. Rates apply to cell means and integrated face heat for this uniform mesh and these histories.",
